        "created_at": "2017-11-08T16:00:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My impression of what they said about his RPG future was along the lines of, \"We don't have anything planned, but it's totally possible that the clones are under there somewhere, so you could probably do something with it.\"</p><p>Basically, every summation of what they have planned with the RPG ends with an unspoken, \"But if you want to do otherwise, that's cool too.\"</p>",
