        "id": 208210,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-08T17:27:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Spite's flavor as a remorseless spree killer just out for funsies has its appeal, but it's also increasingly one-note as the storyline goes on.</p><p>In contrast, other awful villains tend to either have style (Apostate, Heartbreaker), or some sort of grand scheme beyond merely mayhem (Biomancer, Voss), making them easier to keep doing more stuff with.</p>",
