        "created_at": "2017-11-08T17:55:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"saykhia\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/saykhia/48/2132_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> saykhia:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I like Spite's character arc but was very disappointed that the Agent of Gloom arc does not have a satisfying payoff.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>An unfortunate side-effect of the meta of OblivAeon.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
